"Fan controller: input temperature 32°C → fuzzify (hot 0.6) → rule: IF hot THEN speed fast → aggregate → defuzzify to e.g. 74 rpm. Sugeno: rules w=0.6 (z=20) and w=0.4 (z=80) ⇒ z=(0.6·20+0.4·80)/1.0=44.",
["Blocks: fuzzifier → rule base + inference engine → defuzzifier.","Mamdani: fuzzy outputs; Sugeno (TSK): crisp linear/constant outputs.","Defuzzification: centroid (centre of gravity), mean of maxima, weighted average.","Knowledge from experts in IF–THEN form.","Robust to noise; no precise mathematical model needed.","Applications: ACs, washing machines, ABS, cameras."],
