["Perceptron: output=step(w·x+b).","Learning rule: w←w+η(t−y)x.","Converges if data is linearly separable (perceptron convergence theorem).","Cannot solve XOR (Minsky & Papert 1969).","Multi-layer networks overcome the limitation.","Qualitative view: capability, limits, convergence, role of η."],
